    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Area of Effect/7/0",
      "record_key": "glossary.area_of_effect",
      "label": "Area of Effect",
      "leaf_id": "5ef92f4d-62c2-5d57-b154-d4689beb9dc4",
      "page_index": 176,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 8,
      "text": "“Cover.”"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Area of Effect/7/1",
      "record_key": "glossary.area_of_effect",
      "label": "Area of Effect",
      "leaf_id": "5ef92f4d-62c2-5d57-b154-d4689beb9dc4",
      "page_index": 176,
      "char_start": 8,
      "char_end": 221,
      "text": " If the creator of an area of effect places it at an unseen point and an obstruction—such as a wall— is between the creator and that point, the point of origin comes into being on the near side of the obstruction."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "9208b6e4-4afa-58cf-a226-43f4b95b35e8",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 21,
      "text": "Cone [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8d464d21-2e78-58a7-8045-37df4d393b0e",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 117,
      "text": "A Cone is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin in a direction its creator chooses."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8d464d21-2e78-58a7-8045-37df4d393b0e",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 117,
      "char_end": 222,
      "text": " A Cone’s width at any point along its length is equal to that point’s distance from the point of origin."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8d464d21-2e78-58a7-8045-37df4d393b0e",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 222,
      "char_end": 328,
      "text": " For example, a Cone is 15 feet wide at a point along its length that is 15 feet from the point of origin."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/1/3",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8d464d21-2e78-58a7-8045-37df4d393b0e",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 328,
      "char_end": 389,
      "text": " The effect that creates a Cone specifies its maximum length."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cone/1/4",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cone",
      "label": "Cone [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8d464d21-2e78-58a7-8045-37df4d393b0e",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 389,
      "char_end": 489,
      "text": " A Cone’s point of origin isn’t included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cube/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cube",
      "label": "Cube [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "74587a82-5acc-5b79-bf6c-9500a48592ea",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 21,
      "text": "Cube [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cube/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cube",
      "label": "Cube [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ebc0f678-517f-5fbb-a973-ac8f11c4a30a",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 121,
      "text": "A Cube is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin located anywhere on a face of the Cube."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cube/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cube",
      "label": "Cube [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ebc0f678-517f-5fbb-a973-ac8f11c4a30a",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 121,
      "char_end": 206,
      "text": " The effect that creates a Cube specifies its size, which is the length of each side."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cube/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cube",
      "label": "Cube [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ebc0f678-517f-5fbb-a973-ac8f11c4a30a",
      "page_index": 178,
      "char_start": 206,
      "char_end": 306,
      "text": " A Cube’s point of origin isn’t included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cylinder/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cylinder",
      "label": "Cylinder [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "16894c5c-319b-5ce0-aeef-e7aca9805a38",
      "page_index": 179,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 25,
      "text": "Cylinder [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cylinder/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cylinder",
      "label": "Cylinder [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "4954b589-14e5-5d13-9bf4-0e558b9bb915",
      "page_index": 179,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 154,
      "text": "A Cylinder is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin located at the center of the circular top or bottom of the Cylinder."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cylinder/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cylinder",
      "label": "Cylinder [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "4954b589-14e5-5d13-9bf4-0e558b9bb915",
      "page_index": 179,
      "char_start": 154,
      "char_end": 260,
      "text": " The effect that creates a Cylinder specifies the radius of the Cylinder’s base and the Cylinder’s height."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Cylinder/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.cylinder",
      "label": "Cylinder [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "4954b589-14e5-5d13-9bf4-0e558b9bb915",
      "page_index": 179,
      "char_start": 260,
      "char_end": 324,
      "text": " A Cylinder’s point of origin is included in the area of effect."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Emanation/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.emanation",
      "label": "Emanation [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "a38fd7d6-3a9e-5d16-b135-c235e6c25619",
      "page_index": 180,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 26,
      "text": "Emanation [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Emanation/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.emanation",
      "label": "Emanation [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8834ac19-e730-5c84-89e7-62882dddb1f2",
      "page_index": 180,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 112,
      "text": "An Emanation is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a creature or an object in all directions."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Emanation/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.emanation",
      "label": "Emanation [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8834ac19-e730-5c84-89e7-62882dddb1f2",
      "page_index": 180,
      "char_start": 112,
      "char_end": 184,
      "text": " The effect that creates an Emanation specifies the distance it extends."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Emanation/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.emanation",
      "label": "Emanation [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8834ac19-e730-5c84-89e7-62882dddb1f2",
      "page_index": 180,
      "char_start": 184,
      "char_end": 304,
      "text": " An Emanation moves with the creature or object that is its origin unless it is an instantaneous or a stationary effect."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Emanation/1/3",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.emanation",
      "label": "Emanation [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "8834ac19-e730-5c84-89e7-62882dddb1f2",
      "page_index": 180,
      "char_start": 304,
      "char_end": 422,
      "text": " An Emanation’s origin (creature or object) isn’t included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Line/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.line",
      "label": "Line [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "9e2d76bb-c579-5789-964f-406b39b02673",
      "page_index": 183,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 21,
      "text": "Line [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Line/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.line",
      "label": "Line [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ed92551f-ae72-5a8d-85ff-79362ab75cda",
      "page_index": 183,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 140,
      "text": "A Line is an area of effect that extends from a point of origin in a straight path along its length and covers an area defined by its width."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Line/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.line",
      "label": "Line [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ed92551f-ae72-5a8d-85ff-79362ab75cda",
      "page_index": 183,
      "char_start": 140,
      "char_end": 203,
      "text": " The effect that creates a Line specifies its length and width."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Line/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.line",
      "label": "Line [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "ed92551f-ae72-5a8d-85ff-79362ab75cda",
      "page_index": 183,
      "char_start": 203,
      "char_end": 303,
      "text": " A Line’s point of origin isn’t included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Sphere/0/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.sphere",
      "label": "Sphere [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "dafddf9b-a89d-557f-9b8f-1081bd7e170f",
      "page_index": 187,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 23,
      "text": "Sphere [Area of Effect]"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Sphere/1/0",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.sphere",
      "label": "Sphere [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "32cb0337-705d-5107-8c43-31178d968a23",
      "page_index": 187,
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 110,
      "text": "A Sphere is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin outward in all directions."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Sphere/1/1",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.sphere",
      "label": "Sphere [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "32cb0337-705d-5107-8c43-31178d968a23",
      "page_index": 187,
      "char_start": 110,
      "char_end": 206,
      "text": " The effect that creates a Sphere specifies the distance it extends as the radius of the Sphere."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "Sphere/1/2",
      "record_key": "area_of_effect.sphere",
      "label": "Sphere [Area of Effect]",
      "leaf_id": "32cb0337-705d-5107-8c43-31178d968a23",
      "page_index": 187,
      "char_start": 206,
      "char_end": 277,
      "text": " A Sphere’s point of origin is included in the Sphere’s area of effect."
    }
  ],
